flowchart TD
MOOController["**MOO Controller**<br/>Starts optimization<br/>Configures NSGA2 parameters"]
DecisionVector["**Decision Vector**<br/>6 buffer capacities<br/>Discrete values {1-10}"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Defines problem for NSGA2<br/>Attributes n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Method _evaluate"]
NSGA2Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Generates populations<br/>Applies selection and replacement"]
GeneticOps["**Genetic Operators**<br/>Sampling IntegerRandomSampling<br/>Crossover SBX<br/>Mutation PM"]
Population["**Population**<br/>Collection of candidate vectors<br/>Evolved each generation"]
ParallelPool["**Parallel Worker Pool**<br/>multiprocessing pool with fixed cores<br/>Distributes evaluations"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>evaluate_single_individual<br/>Manages multiple replications per candidate<br/>Returns [wip negative_throughput]"]
SimulationRunner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>run_simulation_with_caps<br/>Builds factory topology with provided capacities<br/>Executes warmup and measurement runs"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap delay<br/>Methods put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
Machine["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>Methods run waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
Measurement["**Measurement and KPIs**<br/>Collects throughput average WIP produced parts<br/>Collects per machine energy and times"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Objective 1 minimize WIP<br/>Objective 2 maximize throughput stored as negative value"]
History["**History Recorder**<br/>Saves population and evaluated objectives per generation"]
CSVExport["**Export to CSV**<br/>Writes feasible solutions and KPIs to results file"]

MOOController --> BufferProblem
MOOController --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> GeneticOps
NSGA2Algorithm --> Population
NSGA2Algorithm --> History

Population --> ParallelPool
DecisionVector --> Population

ParallelPool --> Evaluator
BufferProblem --> ParallelPool
Evaluator --> SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner --> DelayBuffer
SimulationRunner --> Machine
SimulationRunner --> Measurement

DelayBuffer --> Machine
Machine --> Measurement
Measurement --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> Objectives
Objectives --> NSGA2Algorithm
History --> CSVExport

CSVExport --> MOOController